<title>UK: LME metals dull, slightly softer in PM trading.</title>
<headline>LME metals dull, slightly softer in PM trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Off lows, but still slightly weaker in thin trading. Cash/threes backwardation about $7 narrower at $88/$90.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Marginally weaker, but above $1,580.</p>
<p>ZINC - Barely softer at $1,370.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Drops below $7,300. TIN/LEAD - Quietly easier.</p>
</text>
